 >> How do I specify the two values when multiple is not allowed. I did not
 >> get it....

You used
 > c(as.integer(100),as.integer(100))
[1] 100 100

 > c(5000, 5000)
[1] 5000 5000

which leads to space separated values. But we want

 > paste(as.integer(100), as.integer(100), sep=",")
[1] "100,100"

